      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "4 ANCHOR PLANTED",
      "narration_text": "Here's what a skill actually is: one file. Matter-briefing is a folder holding a single SKILL.md — instructions for turning whatever's currently on record into one structured read: posture, what's changed, next deadline, open questions, and a risk check.",
